give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[[[{"text":"The first amoung us discovered an ore deep in the bowels of our world.\nOnce broke this ore produced a red dust.\n\nIt was later discovered that this dust had magical properties that could enable other devices within our world to move and change."}]],[[{"text":"This became common knowledge and many have gone on to make many devices and things using the red dust from the redstone."}]],[[{"text":"But lost to time was the fact that one fought a dark demon with glowing purple eyes with one such ore and in doing so unlocked a property that has been lost to all but a few."}]],[[{"text":"Place a redstone ore and while holding a named paper in your left hand if you place a piece of dust on the ore you will magically create an anchor point that will hold for so long as the ore is there and unbroken."}]],[[{"text":"When you do this twice with two different names you will be able to travel between these anchors regardless of distance in our over world. Simply hold the named paper in your left hand while crouching on top of the anchor to transport yourself."}]],[[{"text":"There are stories of course of how to find the original tomb where this all began, some say it is of course a myth but some truly believe."}]],[[{"text":"\nSome scholars found ancient texts that describe ᔑ variation 𝙹⎓ ℸ ̣ ⍑ᒷ ore ʖᒷ╎リ⊣ !¡ꖎᔑᓵᒷ↸ ᔑリ↸ ℸ ̣ ⍑ᒷ ⚍ᓭᒷ 𝙹⎓ ᔑ ↸⚍ᓭℸ ̣ ╎リ 𝙹リᒷ ⍑ᔑリ↸ ᔑリ ᔑリ ender pearl in the other to move to this tomb."}]],[[{"text":"Chronicled by Smurfy Dragon"}]]],title:"World Anchors",author:"Smurfy Dragon",generation:3},custom_name=[{"text":"World Anchors","italic":false}],lore=[[{"text":"History of the Anchors","italic":false}]],item_name=[{"text":"World Anchor Chronicle","italic":false}],rarity=uncommon,enchantment_glint_override=true]
